{
  "profile_id": "tilefinch-game-profile-v1.1",
  "title": "Tilefinch Game Profile",
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "satisfies": [
    "tilefinch-game-profile-v1"
  ],
  "changes_from_v1": [
    "webgl.shader_source_bytes_each 16384 -> 65536",
    "webgl.vertex_uniform_vectors 16 -> 128 and fragment_uniform_vectors 4 -> 16, counted over active uniforms per stage",
    "webgl.varying_vectors 2 -> 8",
    "blendFuncSeparate accepts split alpha factors; the colour factors apply to all channels of the opaque drawing buffer",
    "mipmap minification filters sample the base level; generateMipmap succeeds without building levels",
    "uniform arrays and structs; int, bool, mat2 and mat3 uniform setters; vertexAttrib*fv; accepted no-op stencil and blendColor setters",
    "numeric and uniform colour factors and uniform-only selections of them are applied exactly",
    "a uniform alpha test discard is drawn as the GE alpha test",
    "colour math reading only attributes, uniforms and numbers is evaluated per vertex and interpolated, linked with a warning; limits.webgl per_vertex_program_* added",
    "built-in scene-library materials map onto GE per-vertex lighting, fog and point sprites",
    "the 64 KiB GE display list is allocated by a realm's first WebGL frame and freed with the realm; if memory is exhausted at that frame the flush fails and the context is lost, as for any WebGL allocation failure",
    "web_audio AudioParam automation timelines replace the v1 curve and target-ramp subset; linear and exponential ramp methods schedule ramps instead of setting the value at once",
    "web_audio createBuffer, new AudioBuffer and channel data (8000-96000 Hz float buffers from the same PCM pool)",
    "web_audio BiquadFilterNode, the first filter on a source's chain",
    "web_audio decodeAudioData rejects MP3 and Ogg with EncodingError naming the format",
    "limits.web_audio_automation added",
    "web_audio source chains of up to 8 nodes (limits.web_audio_automation.nodes_per_source_chain); a source whose chain does not reach the destination is silent",
    "web_audio MediaStreamAudioSourceNode for a getUserMedia microphone track, heard through the destination only while headphones are connected",
    "web_audio AnalyserNode time-domain and frequency data, fftSize 32-2048; limits.web_audio_analysis added"
  ],
  "status": "experimental",
  "authority": "docs/GAME_PROFILE.md",
  "target": {
